      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">Multiple Itineraries</div><h3>Top China Tours</h3><p>Combine Shanghai with Beijing, Xi'an, Guilin, and more on a comprehensive China journey. Experience the Bund's colonial elegance alongside the Great Wall's ancient majesty.</p><a href="/top-china-tours.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Tours</a></div>
    </div>
   /assets/images/desert-dunes.jpg"lazy" src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Private Shanghai Tour"></div>
      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">Customizable</div><h3>Private Shanghai Experience</h3><p>Craft your perfect Shanghai stay — Art Deco walking tour, dim sum breakfast in the Old City, private cruise on the Huangpu, and a bespoke evening at a speakeasy bar in the former French Concession.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-outline">Plan My Trip</a></div>
